      "finding": "Consumes only preserved full3parameter firstlaw+Smarr, retaining angular work dJ and electric work dQ_e, not the formerly false rotating fixeda calibration. Exact constants held fixed give Epar=(c4/G_N)m, j=(G_N/c3)J, q=gamma_e Q_e, OmegaSI=cOmega, kappa_acc=c\u00b2kappa_geom, PhiSI=(c/alpha)Phi_geom=c\u00b2Phi_geom/sqrt(4pi epsilon0 G_N). Multiplying the full geometric law and Smarr by c4/G_N gives every displayed physical coefficient. Strict subextremality gives positive horizon radius/nonzero generator and kappa, with a=q=0 covered separately for every m>0 by the current Schwarzschild lemma. Voltage refers to the displayed potential gauge with zero reference at infinity, not an arbitrary-gauge measurement. No ADM/Komar, dynamics, entropy/calibration or extremal claim is inferred."
